{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22214","headline":"过李生 · 白居易","name":"过李生","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苹小蒲叶短，南湖春水生。\n子近湖边住，静境称高情。\n我爲郡司马，散拙无所营。\n使君知性野，衙退任闲行。\n行携小榼出，逢花辄独倾。\n半酣到子舍，下马扣柴荆。\n何以引我步，绕篱竹万茎。\n何以醒我酒，吴音吟一声。\n须臾进野饭，饭稻茹芹英。\n白瓯青竹箸，俭洁无羶腥。\n欲去复裴回，夕鸦已飞鸣。\n何当重游此，待君湖水平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22214.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22214","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}